        "@value": "Leif Vollebekk - Winnipeg Folk Festival"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Leif Vollebekk is a Montreal-adopted singer-songwriter. He will release his highly anticipated fourth full-length album New Ways on November 1st, the follow-up to his breakthrough Polaris Music Prize finalist, Juno-nominated record Twin Solitude. "
      }
    ],
