        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "JP Hoe Hoe Hoe - POSTPONED TO DEC. 16 - Winnipeg Folk Festival"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The JP Hoe Hoe Hoe Holiday Show has become a tried and true tradition for so many of us and never fails to sell out quickly! We’re excited to bring this beloved show back for the 17th time to the Burton Cummings Theatre on December 10, 2022. Join us for an unforgettable evening of music and holiday magic!"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#url": [
