        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Hawksley Workman is a JUNO Award-winning, Gold Record-certified singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist. From his groundbreaking, self-produced indie debut For Him and the Girls (1999) to his chart-topping singles of the 2020s,…"
