        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Park Theatre Wheelchair accessible venue Wheelchair seating available (4 spots) Limited accessible seating available Seating is available for visually impaired patrons are available Accessible seats must be purchased through Ticketmaster over the phone at 1-855-682-6736 No hearing devices are available No assigned parking Visit myparktheatre.com&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
