        "@value": "Basia Bulat"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Introducing The Garden: a STRINGS ALBUM and a RETROSPECTIVE from a room in Montreal with the windows open, and the wind moving, and the leaves changing, and a spring-coloured secret on the tip of Basia Bulat’s tongue. The band made it in a pandemic. Bulat and her old friend Mark Lawson, with whom she recorded&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
