        "@value": "The Paper Kites"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;“Our hotel window in New York City looked straight into the apartment building across the street. You could see all these windows lighting up and people getting home from their nights out. We just sat there and watched them. It was fascinating. It was living art.” Sam Bentley, frontman for The Paper Kites spoke of the moment the&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
