    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Her sound is similar to her journey – eclectic, always evolving, and unfeigned. Hailing from the small town of Shelburne, Ontario and born to two artists, Ruby was immersed in a musician’s world at a young age. Now, an artist herself, she plugs in and belts out, unapologetically leaving you in awe. Ruby recently released&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
