      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Building Accessibility The front entrance of our building is nearly at sidewalk level. There are no steps, however, there is a small incline at the door threshold of about 2 inches. In the entranceway, there is an elevator that can take people up to the lobby. The elevator is locked, but during events there is&hellip;&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
