t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tThe distance traveled on William Prince’s new album, Further From the Country, is generational, aspirational, and metaphysical. Expansive and declarative, Further From the Country is the work of an artist who meets the challenge of putting incisive and enduring words to this age of uncertainty. William Prince’s perspective - a songwriter who carries great legacies…\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMon\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t27\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tLeith Ross – SOLD OUT\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMonday, April 27 at 8:00 pm - 11:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tSide Stage\t\n\t\n\t\t700 Osborne Street, Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tHailing from a small town near Ottawa, Ontario, singer-songwriter Leith Ross (they / them) channels their honest and emotional storytelling through introspective lyrics and a blend of indie folk with alternative and rock sounds. In 2020, they first introduced their artistry and independently released their debut Motherwell EP. Recorded live, it received widespread praise from tastemakers and fans…\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$40.00\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tJune 2026\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFri\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t12\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tAn Evening with Whitehorse\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tFriday, June 12 at 8:00 pm - 11:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tThe Park Theatre\t\n\t\n\t\t698 Osborne Street, Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tFor the first time, Whitehorse hit the road as a true family band — a full-circle moment where two decades of music-making now spans generations on stage.   With their new album All I Want Is All of It, Whitehorse return to the sound that first defined them: folk-rock romanticism, raw storytelling, and the lived-in…\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$48\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tThu\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t18\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tThe Cat Empire: Riebl Tedesco McGill\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tThursday, June 18 at 8:00 pm - 11:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tWest End Cultural Centre\t\n\t\n\t\t586 Ellice Ave, Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tMaking their Canadian debut, Riebl Tedesco McGill bring together three of Australia’s most accomplished and genre-defying musicians for a rare and intimate live experience. Uniting the distinct voices of Felix Riebl, Richard Tedesco, and Ollie McGill, this collaborative trio blends songwriting, virtuoso musicianship, and deep musical storytelling into something truly unique. From the fiery, intricate…\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$40.00 – $45.00\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFri\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t26\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tWillows & Tinge\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tFriday, June 26 at 7:00 pm - 8:30 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tThe Forks\t\n\t\n\t\t1 Forks Market Road, Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tWillows is coming to Winnipeg for a free concert on Friday, June 26, co-presented by the sākihiwē festival, the Winnipeg Folk Festival, and The Forks! She’ll be trading songs with Tinge under the canopy at The Forks for the full 90 minutes. Indigenous Coffeehouse Live Willows & Tinge Presented by the sākihiwē festival, the Winnipeg…\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tFREE\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tAugust 2026\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFri\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t14\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tRichard Inman\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tFriday, August 14 at 8:00 pm - 11:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tWest End Cultural Centre\t\n\t\n\t\t586 Ellice Ave, Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\tHe’s got a new record! Hear it here first! Road-weary, dusty and worn down from thousands of miles, hundreds of shows a year, from Canada to Denmark, Germany and back, Richard Inman is an authentic story telling troubadour. Playing for thousands at festivals or dozens in a smoke filled back road bar in rural Saskatchewan, Inman's…\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t$20.00\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\tPrevious Events\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\tToday\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tNext Events\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSubscribe to calendar\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tGoogle Calendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tiCalendar\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook 365\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tOutlook Live\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tExport .ics file\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\tExport Outlook .ics file\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t( function () {\n\t\tvar completed = false;\n\n\t\tfunction initBreakpoints() {\n\t\t\tif ( completed ) {\n\t\t\t\t// This was fired already and completed no need to attach to the event listener.\n\t\t\t\tdocument.removeEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'undefined' === typeof window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tif ( 'function' !== typeof (window.tribe.events.views.breakpoints.setup) ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\tvar container = document.querySelectorAll( '[data-view-breakpoint-pointer=\"1f1b0bc0-f6ae-4e36-8870-dcf8df5db078\"]' );\n\t\t\tif ( ! container ) {\n\t\t\t\treturn;\n\t\t\t}\n\n\t\t\twindow.tribe.events.views.breakpoints.setup( container );\n\t\t\tcompleted = true;\n\t\t\t// This was fired already and completed no need to attach to the event listener.\n\t\t\tdocument.removeEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n\t\t}\n\n\t\t// Try to init the breakpoints right away.\n\t\tinitBreakpoints();\n\t\tdocument.addEventListener( 'DOMContentLoaded', initBreakpoints );\n\t})();\n\n{\"tvn1\":\"df91529f48\",\"tvn2\":\"\"}\n\t"
