 her Indigenous heritage inspires her work, reflecting traditions of preserving culture through…\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tFREE\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tFebruary 2025\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSat\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t22\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tSam Fournier, Jane Fuentez and Clementine\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSaturday, February 22, 2025 at 2:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tMillennium Library\t\n\t\n\t\t251 Donald Street, Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tFREE\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tMarch 2025\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSat\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t22\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tXander Boulard, Ben Notes, and skyblues\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSaturday, March 22, 2025 at 1:00 pm - 2:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tMillennium Library\t\n\t\n\t\t251 Donald Street, Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tFREE\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tApril 2025\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSat\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t26\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tArlo Jones, Lily Bee Vanderhooft, and Melody Pearson Munroe\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSaturday, April 26, 2025 at 1:00 pm - 2:00 pm\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tBill and Helen Norrie Library\t\n\t\n\t\t15 Poseidon Bay, Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tFREE\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tOctober 2025\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSat\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t25\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\tFONTINE, Kris Ulrich, and Taylor Jackson\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSaturday, October 25, 20