    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\tJP Hoe Hoe Hoe – SOLD OUT\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tDecember 20, 2024 @ 8:00 pm\nDoors open at 7:00 PM\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tBurton Cummings Theatre\n364 Smith Street, Winnipeg, MB\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t$29.50 – 59.50\nAdvance plus fees\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBUY TICKETS\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tAll sales are final except in the event of a full cancellation.\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tIt’s the most magical time of the year! Don’t miss your chance to grab tickets for the 19th annual JP Hoe Hoe Hoe Holiday Show, happening December 20, 2024, at the Burton Cummings Theatre! A beloved tradition, this festive event delivers an unforgettable night of music and holiday spirit. Tickets sell out fast, so act quickly to secure your spot!\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\t"
      }
