        "@value": "Ariel Posen&#8217;s music occupies the space between genres. It&#8217;s a rootsy sound that nods to his influences — heartland rock &amp; roll, electrified Americana, blue-eyed soul, R&amp;B, Beatles-inspired pop —&hellip;"
      }
