    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\tGeorgia Harmer\nwith Taylor Jackson\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tNovember 29, 2025 @ 8:00 pm\nDoors open at 7:00 PM\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tThe Park Theatre\n698 Osborne Street, Winnipeg, MB\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t$25.00\nAdvance plus fees\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBUY TICKETS\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tAll sales are final except in the event of a full cancellation.\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tGeorgia Harmer is known for her ethereal voice and lyricism. She has emerged as one of Canada’s most compelling voices in indie music. Her songs display a vast emotional range and striking vulnerability. Harmer’s upcoming sophomore album, Eye of the Storm, will be released this summer and showcases an evolution in her songwriting. Her debut album, Stay in Touch, captivated audiences and garnered praise from publications like Stereogum and SPIN. We cannot wait to welcome her back to Winnipeg!\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\t"
      }
    ]
  },
