    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\tJP Hoe Hoe Hoe Holiday Show\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tDecember 19, 2025 @ 8:00 pm\nDoors open at 7:00 PM\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tBurton Cummings Theatre\n364 Smith Street, Winnipeg, MB\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t$29.50 – 64.50\nAdvance plus fees\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBUY TICKETS\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tAll sales are final except in the event of a full cancellation.\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tSpreading that holiday joy for the 20th time! Tickets go on sale Thursday, October 23 at 10:00 AM. Don’t miss your chance to grab tickets to the annual JP Hoe Hoe Hoe Holiday Show, happening December 19, 2025, at Burton Cummings Theatre!\nA beloved tradition, this festive event promises an unforgettable night of music and holiday spirit. Tickets sell out fast, so act quickly to secure your spot!\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\t"
      }
    ]
  },
