      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tFolk Fest In The City Workshop\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tJaxon Haldane, Arlo and Nick Hamm\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tSaturday, March 14 at 1:00 pm - 2:00 pm\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tMillennium Library\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tFREE\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\tThe Winnipeg Folk Festival and Winnipeg City Libraries are teaming up to bring you a FREE acoustic series featuring local talent. This series brings the same vibrant energy and creativity seen at our summer Festival workshops, with artists sharing songs, and stories in an intimate setting.\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\t"
      }
