  {
    "@id": "http://www.winnipegfolkfestival.ca/genid/2a46d70c7d614eb1",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/WebPage"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.winnipegfolkfestival.ca/concert/richard-inman/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\tRichard Inman\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tAugust 14, 2026 @ 8:00 pm\nDoors open at 7:00 PM\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tWest End Cultural Centre\n586 Ellice Ave, Winnipeg, MB\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t$20.00\nAdvance plus fees\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBUY TICKETS\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tAll sales are final except in the event of a full cancellation.\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\tHe’s got a new record! Hear it here first! Road-weary, dusty and worn down from thousands of miles, hundreds of shows a year, from Canada to Denmark, Germany and back, Richard Inman is an authentic story telling troubadour. Playing for thousands at festivals or dozens in a smoke filled back road bar in rural Saskatchewan, Inman’s honesty has connected him to a devoted cult following and cemented his place as a Canadian songwriting giant.\nJoin us at The WECC Friday Aug 14th for Richard’s album release concert.\n\n\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\t"
      }
    ]
  },
